# .dockerignore — frontend build context.
# The Dockerfile runs `npm install` and `vite build` inside the image, so host-side
# node_modules / dist must not be copied in (wrong-platform native modules, stale bundles,
# and a `COPY . .` layer that changes on every local build).
#
# .env* files are deliberately NOT ignored here: vite reads .env.production at build time.

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
npm-debug.log*
.vite
